Our solution will assist staff in retrieving information from internal procedures, care protocols, and applicable regulations. It will also provide drafting assistance for clinical and administrative content, such as discharge summaries and medical reports. Additionally, our platform will support dossier handling by surfacing relevant information, recalling applicable rules, and suggesting actions or verifications.

