Our proposal addresses all the requirements and constraints outlined in the call for tenders. We provide a non-decisional support tool that assists staff in their daily activities while ensuring compliance with regulatory requirements. Our solution is designed to improve the efficiency of staff and the quality and safety of care delivered to patients, aligning with CHRB's sustainable development policy.

We believe our Atelier platform, combined with our expertise and commitment to CSR and sustainability, makes us an ideal partner for this project. We are confident that our solution will meet the client's needs and provide a competitive advantage in the market.
